,"/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/cass-county"],["ARC or PLC in Cass County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/cass-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids in Cass County came in under 90% of normal in October to November for 40 of the 75 years since 1951. So far in 2026, the middle sat at 66% of normal in May to June 2026 and 61% of normal in June to July 2026. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grid 31933 got just 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
